/Title (GameQuest uses Valorant, Riot Games' tactical 5v5 shooter, as its theme. Player gamertags \(TenZ, zekken, Derke\), agents \(Jett, Raze, Sage, Sova, Phoenix\) and maps \(Ascent, Bind, Haven, Split, Icebox, Lotus\) are all taken from the game, so the data looks like something a real tournament would produce. The scoring is a simplified model written for this project and is not Riot's official ranking or rating formula.)
